	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 「BB戦士三国伝」10周年を記念して、Blu-ray BOXでしか入手できなった幻のキット“麗しき女将軍”貂蝉キュベレイが装いを新たに再キット化！",
			"• 成形色はより華やかで鮮やかな色へ変更され、目のデザインをBB戦士フォーマットに変更！",
			"• 貂蝉キュベレイのイメージにあわせた紫の武将座が付属する！",
			"• さらに、パッケージイラストは新規描き起こしとなっている！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• To commemorate the 10th anniversary of \"BB Senshi Sangokuden\", the phantom Kit \"Beautiful Female General\" Diao Chan Qubeley, who was only available on Blu-ray BOX, has been re-kitted with a new look!",
			"• The molding color has been changed to a more gorgeous and vivid color, and the eye design has been changed to the BB Senshi format!",
			"• A purple military commander's seat that matches the image of Diaochan Qubeley is included!",
			"• Furthermore, the package illustration has been newly drawn!"
		]
	},
